# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Mosquito Radar -- keep the repository to code, configs and small result files.
# Datasets, generated audio / features and trained models are large and are rebuilt with the commands in README.md.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- datasets (third-party licences; downloaded by src/download.py or by hand) ---
data/raw/
data/noise/public/
# your own household recordings: personal audio, keep out of version control (the folder README stays)
data/noise/custom/*
!data/noise/custom/README.md

# --- generated data (rebuilt by the pipeline) ---
data/processed/features/
data/processed/windows/
data/synthetic/clips*/
data/synthetic/noise_bank*/

# --- trained models, predictions and large arrays ---
*.keras
*.h5
*.tflite
*.npy
*.npz
results/**/predictions/

# --- audio and archives anywhere ---
*.wav
*.flac
*.mp3
*.ogg
*.m4a
*.zip
*.rar
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.tgz

# --- Python ---
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.pytest_cache/
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/
.env

# --- editors / OS / local tool settings ---
.DS_Store
.vscode/
.idea/
.claude/settings.local.json
